{
  "_id": "UwPHQ39LXpipmfaU",
  "name": "浪客斗篷 Rogue's Mantle (BMT)",
  "type": "equipment",
  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "BMT",
      "page": "37",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>奇物，珍稀（需同调）</em></p><p>这件深色的、带兜帽的厚布斗篷充斥着秘密和欺瞒的魔法。着装它时，你可以获得以下增益：</p><p><em><strong>黑暗视觉Darkvision。</strong></em>你获得60尺黑暗视觉&amp;Reference[rule=darkvision]。如果你已经拥有黑暗视觉&amp;Reference[rule=darkvision]，它会将你的黑暗视觉&amp;Reference[rule=darkvision]范围增加60尺。</p><p><em><strong>阴影移动Move in Shadows。</strong></em>若你身处处于微光光照&amp;Reference[rule=dimlight]{dim light}或黑暗中，你便可以用一个附赠动作，将你和你所穿着或携带的任何物品一起传送到30尺内的可见未被占据的微光光照&amp;Reference[rule=dimlight]{dim light}或黑暗空间中。随后直至你本回合结束前，你下一次发动近战攻击时具有优势。</p><p><em><strong>刻意树敌Willful Enmity。</strong></em>你可以从斗篷施展<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.VPJpFGhhBofVfsku]{敌意术 Antagonize}</em>（豁免DC15）（见第7章）。此法术一经斗篷施放，直到下次黎明前不能再次以此法施放该法术。</p><p>This dark, hooded mantle of thick cloth is infused with secretive and deceptive magic. While wearing it, you gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Darkvision\"><span class=\"bold\">Darkvision.</span> You gain &amp;Reference[rule=darkvision] within a range of 60 feet. If you already have &amp;Reference[rule=darkvision], the mantle increases your &amp;Reference[rule=darkvision]'s range by 60 feet instead.</p></li><li><p data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Move in Shadows\"><span class=\"bold\">Move in Shadows.</span> While you are in &amp;Reference[rule=dimlight]{dim light} or darkness, you can use a bonus action to teleport, along with anything you are wearing or carrying, up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space you can see that is also in &amp;Reference[rule=dimlight]{dim light} or darkness. You then have advantage on the first melee attack you make before the end of the turn.</p></li><li><p data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Willful Enmity\"><span class=\"bold\">Willful Enmity.</span> You can cast the @spell[Antagonize|BMT] spell (save DC 15) from the mantle. Once the mantle has cast the spell, it can't cast the spell again until the next dawn.</p></li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
